1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Welcome to the Local AI Workshop. Today we set up a small language model
right on your laptop.

2
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:41,500
First we download Ollama from the website and run one install command.

3
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Now we pull a model. The pull command grabs a few gigabytes, so stretch first.

4
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:40,000
With the model running we try a chat prompt about cameras and photography.

5
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:22,000
Privacy is the point: your words never leave this machine.
